worthy AI. The source code is accessible at https://github.com/zyy970/Meta-Interpretability-Framework. Furthermore, this work addresses a critical aspect of the National Institute of Standards and Technology's AI Risk Management Framework, specifically under "Artificial Intelligence Governance" and the sub-component "Artificial Intelligence Interpretability." Given that our framework operates within a supervised learning framework, it addresses the supervised aspect of the NIST's "Artificial Intelligence Development" phase, sub-component "Model Development."

